WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:28.770
The School of the
Undefeated of the East!

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:29.690
Sekiha!

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:31.860
Tenkyoken!

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.280
Now, everyone.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.690
Some strange things
sure can happen.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.700
Master Asia has taught
Domon his ultimate attack.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.120
What could motivate him
to do something like this?

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.580
And what's the connection
between the ultimate Fighter...

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.540
...he's looking for,
and the Devil Gundam?

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:52.090
In the meantime...

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.960
...Domon is preparing to fight his
surrogate master, Schwarz Bruder...

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.090
...in this larger than life match-up.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.510
Will Domon be able to get
past this impenetrable wall?

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:03.890
And now!

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.970
Gundam Fight!

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.430
Ready! Go!

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:14.520
A Ruthless Fight!
Schwarz's Last Match

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.650
Well...

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:20.530
The Tournament's Battle Royale
is almost upon us.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:21.780
Yes.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.410
It'll take place following
this final match.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.660
I'd heard that...

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:33.080
...Domon and Schwarz faced
each other in a Gundam Fight.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.380
And it seems that Schwarz
easily beat Domon.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.880
But Domon now...

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.680
...has surely come a long way
since that match.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:44.430
You have much confidence.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.300
However...

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.770
...will you still feel the same
confidence after I show you this?

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.600
Th-this is...!

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.810
The two undefeated Fighters...

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.400
...will face off in a Timed Death
Match with electric net...

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.490
...and explosives.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.530
One must defeat his opponent
within the time limit.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.830
Otherwise, both will be trapped...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.790
...when 50,000 time bombs
are detonated in the ring.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.460
Everything, including the ring,
will be wiped out.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:16.960
However...

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:20.130
...to ensure a full recovery
of the Devil Gundam...

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.970
...we must rid ourselves
of all obstacles.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.180
After that...

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.470
...I'll have my ultimate
Fighter awakened.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:39.690
Andrew Graham will return to
his home country of Neo Canada.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.760
And focus on treatment.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.660
I see.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.370
Sorry, Argo.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.870
If only I'd paid better attention.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.700
It's not your fault.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.040
Don't worry.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.830
By the way, Domon...

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.750
...haven't you found Allenby yet?

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:54.580
No.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.130
Allenby's disappearance.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.590
The Devil Gundam.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.650
Neo Hong Kong is
full of mysteries.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.590
Domon!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.180
Domon Kasshu!

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.600
This is no time to be
idly gossiping!

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.760
Commissioner Karato.

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:09.810
Is anything wrong?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.480
Not just anything.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.520
Take a look at this.

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:15.770
Huh?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.520
Rain has resigned.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:18.900
What'd you say?!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:24.620
"My role as Gundam crew seems
to be too great of a burden."

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.490
"My father..."

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.410
"...had encouraged me by
saying that I'd do well..."

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.900
"...because I've known
Domon since we were kids."

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.420
"However, now that
I've lost his trust..."

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.750
"...there's nothing left for me to do."

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.920
"I wish to take a leave of absence.
Rain Mikamura."

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:47.930
Leave of absence?!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.060
How can she be so selfish?!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.890
You fool.
You're the selfish one.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.270
Rain has a strong
sense of responsibility.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.500
You pressured her
until she snapped.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.190
That's why the Kasshu family
can't be fully trusted!

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:10.160
Anyhow, I'm appointing
some of Neo Japan's top crew...

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.450
...as your support.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.000
I'm the leader, Officer Akino.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.160
Pleased to meet you.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.050
I don't need any support.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.920
I can fight this on my own.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.630
Not a chance.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.760
You're responsible for this mess.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.170
You'll make sure you
win this match.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:28.890
Then you're in the
Battle Royale Final.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.050
Got that?

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:44.190
<i>Only one match remains</i>
<i>in the Preliminary Round</i>.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.900
This doesn't concern me anymore.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:53.580
Kyoji!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.090
I'm sure that man was Kyoji.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.250
But is it possible?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:10.840
Kyoji!

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:14.430
Is that you, Kyoji?!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.690
The Gundam Spiegel...!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.150
Then, this is...

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.570
Rain Mikamura.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.570
You're scouting out
your next opponent?

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.220
Schwarz...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.070
You quit your crew position?

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.580
Yes.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:38.300
I've always done the
best I could...

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.180
...but things haven't
been going well lately.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.170
Oh, no.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.750
Where are my manners?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.370
I'm sorry to bore you
with all this personal stuff.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.510
He's always like that.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.820
Like a child, he sees only
what's before him.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.460
He fails to try to see how
people around him are feeling.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.020
As a martial artist who can
only communicate...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.810
...using his fists...

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.560
...perhaps this is to be expected.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.730
It's so strange.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.070
When I'm talking with this man...

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.360
...it's like I'm with Kyoji.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.530
I feel the same familiarity.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:14.820
Yes.

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:15.870
Back then, too.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.920
The same warmth as Kyoji's
that I felt when I was little.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.670
But, why?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:27.920
Rain...

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:29.880
Rain!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.380
Rain!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:33.510
Y-yes!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.390
If it's difficult finding
a solution...

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.700
Why not see Domon fight
from the other side?

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.850
That'll help you find
what you're looking for.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.170
Mr. Domon Kasshu.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:07.750
What is it?

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.710
I'd like to make final adjustments
to the Mobile Trace System.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.220
Can you get in the
cockpit for me?

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.050
I refuse.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.930
I've never had to do that before.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.600
But, I must insist.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:23.810
The settings for the pilot seem
completely different...

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.940
...compared with Major Ulube's
Rising Gundam.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.490
It seems to have unique settings.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.230
All right.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.110
Thank you very much.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.450
This way, please.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:36.570
What a hassle.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:46.710
Domon...

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.560
It's finally come to this, Bro.

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.810
Your claim to win
all your matches.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.520
Yeah.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.560
But, man...

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.650
...why did your final opponent
have to be Schwarz?

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.280
He didn't have any
trouble defeating...

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.030
...each of us in our
bouts against him.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:16.360
And...

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.740
...the rules call for a Death Match
and a clear winner.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.120
Yeah.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.490
Only one of us will survive this.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:23.450
Domon!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.210
What're you doing with
Fighters from other nations?!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.670
It's almost time!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.960
Hurry up!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.130
Well, excuse us!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.260
Huh?

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.050
I don't recognize that
beautiful lady.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.430
Rain's no longer with us.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.930
What was that?

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.060
What?!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:45.980
I'll fight this with my
own strength, without Rain.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.640
Domon! Get real!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.560
Fight alone?

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.070
What a joke.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.820
As long as you keep
kidding yourself...

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.440
...you'll never beat me!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.450
Schwarz Bruder!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:03.410
Those who don't take advice
have to be taught physically!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.410
That's right.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.120
Until you can defeat me...

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:10.380
...you haven't any chance
against the Devil Gundam!

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:13.130
H-he's right.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.920
If we all end up losing
to Schwarz individually...

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.340
...the Shuffle Alliance
will have no reason to exist.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.840
We're counting on you, Bro!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.470
You don't have to tell me that!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.060
I'll give it my all no matter
who I fight!

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.430
I like that resolve.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:27.980
Well, then!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.400
This'll be a good time
to introduce you...

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.280
...to my new partner!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.490
What?!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:45.490
It can't be...

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.450
Doctor, what's going on?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.420
I want an explanation, Rain!

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:02.930
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.320
Rain...

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.610
What made you go there?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:18.450
No.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:20.280
Don't let this affect you.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.200
Just focus on the match!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:26.240
Right now,
Domon and I are enemies.

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.330
My heart will feel nothing
as I watch him fight.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.120
Domon...

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.790
Let's see you fulfill...

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.040
...your promise.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:38.500
Here we go! Gundam Fight!

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:40.010
Ready!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.760
Go!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:50.220
As the match begins,
the clock starts its countdown.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.690
Will a victor be determined...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.610
...before the bombs explode?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.020
Well, Akino?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.150
How's Domon doing?

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.860
All green for the God Gundam.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.700
Now it's up to the Fighter.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.910
What?

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:08.990
You fool!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.120
Where are you looking?!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.790
Come on, come on,
come on, come on!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.170
Incredible!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.260
The Spiegel Blade lays
a furious assault!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.300
Come on, Domon!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.890
Is this the extent
of your abilities?!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.220
Wh-what?!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.810
At this rate...

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.770
...not only will you not beat me...

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:40.020
...but you'll never defeat
the Devil Gundam!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:45.490
Domon!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.340
Come on! Come on! Here!

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.550
I guess Domon's no match
for Schwarz either.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:09.720
Akino!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.140
Can't you provide him
with any support?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.230
R-right.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.100
Can you hear me,
Mr. Domon?

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.310
The machine has incurred
considerable damage.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.400
Start by using the vernier, and...

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.280
Shut up!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.990
What good is that
kind of support?!

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.450
I can fight on my own!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.620
That's right!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.450
With my God Finger!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.040
Wh-what's wrong?

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.790
I-I can't use my God Finger!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.960
What the...?!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.510
I found the cause.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.300
There's a short in the
Hyper Mode Line.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.640
It can't be repaired
without taking it apart.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.260
Well, there's no time for that!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:56.230
Can't use his God Finger.
Now that's funny!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.310
Come on, Domon.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.690
There's not much time remaining.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.990
No...

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:10.070
Isn't the cockpit adjusted
to Domon's specifications?

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.430
That can be fixed by...

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.040
N-no, I shouldn't.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.470
Right now I belong to
Neo Germany.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.120
B-but...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:23.920
What's wrong, Domon?

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.760
Are you now able to admit
that you can't beat me alone?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.640
Why not try to cry for help?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.390
Rain's right there!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.390
N-not a chance!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.140
Who'd want help...

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.860
...from someone like that?!

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.400
Well, then!

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:51.110
I'll make sure those are
your last words!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.540
No!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.620
That's...

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:03.540
...how he defeated us!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.380
Schwarz's ultimate technique!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.840
Sturm und Drang!

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.980
<i>So, will Schwarz Bruder</i>
<i>now finish off Domon?!</i>

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.020
That's right!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:33.910
Domon!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.710
Is it impossible for me
to defeat Schwarz...

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.790
...relying on my strength alone?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.010
You're pathetic.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.420
You haven't changed one bit.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:52.880
What's that?

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.100
You're the same as
you were back then.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.120
Back then...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:15:59.850
Back then...

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.440
Back then...

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.730
Back then!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:08.900
I'm scared.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.780
I'm scared, Kyoji!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.360
I'm so scared!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.240
Don't cry now, Domon.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.240
But, this is so high up.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.620
Don't be silly.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.210
It's only because you think it is.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.800
Listen.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:27.130
Stop thinking about
what's under your feet.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.750
You're not alone.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.510
Believe in your brother,
and look up ahead.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.170
Then, you'll no longer be afraid.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.550
See?

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.890
Both Dad and Mom are waiting.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.140
But, Kyoji!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.640
Kyoji!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.850
Kyoji!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.270
Don't tell me you're...!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:49.980
I taught you before.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:53.360
If you have the heart to believe in
someone, there's nothing to fear.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:58.280
And I'm sure you can hear it.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.700
The voices of your friends
rooting for you.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:02.370
Voices?

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.210
Domon!

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.000
Don't give up! Domon!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.670
What's the matter, Bro?!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.340
Stand up, Domon!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.420
Domon!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.960
Domon Kasshu!

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:13.840
That's right.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.130
I have them with me.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.720
And...

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:18.680
...most importantly...

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:21.890
Domon, look over here!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.030
Rain...

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:34.580
I have you!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.740
Domon!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:42.540
If you hear me,
do exactly as I say!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.410
Toss the shorted circuit board...

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.250
...and insert a bypass ACS!

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:49.170
Once you've done that,
it should operate!

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.250
R-Rain...!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.460
I'm so sorry.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.090
I was such a fool.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.720
I realized it, watching you
from an opponent's perspective.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:05.480
I'm not a Fighter like
you or Allenby.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.730
So, I can't communicate
with my fists.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:10.730
That's why.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.320
That's why...

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.690
...I began to feel like I was the
only one being left behind.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:18.560
Now, I'm happy even if I can
only provide support.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:20.160
Because...

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:21.620
Because...

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:24.330
Because I realized...

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.990
...that I've been watching
only you, Domon!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.290
Rain...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:32.840
Th-the circuit is recovering!

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:36.260
Rain...

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.310
...I never realized you thought
so much about Domon.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:49.810
Domon!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.480
But you're out of time!

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:58.110
This is the crucial moment...

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:58.700
...Domon!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:02.280
Domon...

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.160
...glad you're back on your feet!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:06.620
I realized for the first time
what I'm fighting for!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.250
Then I'll see if I can
defend myself...

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.520
...against the strength
of your love!

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:14.170
<i>Now!</i>

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.800
<i>Will this be the final</i>
<i>showdown between them?!</i>

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.510
<i>Who will survive?!</i>

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:19.970
<i>The Gundam Spiegel?!</i>

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.890
<i>Or God Gundam?!</i>

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.020
Here I go.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.980
The School of the
Undefeated of the East!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.520
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.070
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.860
As of now...

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.160
...Rain and I fight together!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.610
Take this!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.950
God Finger!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:51.370
Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:06.800
Domon!

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.020
Domon!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:19.940
Wh-what's happening there?

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.330
Domon Kasshu!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.290
What a relief.

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:36.500
Way to go, Domon.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.210
You are no longer alone.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.100
Schwarz!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.180
Domon!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.730
Rain!

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.550
Sorry.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.280
I was such a fool.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:19.300
It's clear that I'll need you to
help me achieve my ideal world.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.760
Congratulations to you,
Master East.

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.260
Domon has just fulfilled
his promise...

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:28.640
...to proceed to the Battle Royale
without losing one match.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.010
However...

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:31.850
...I'm not about to let it
end like this.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.270
Thanks.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.980
I would've been defeated if
you didn't step in and help.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.010
Yeah...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:44.570
But the one who was really
looking out for you is...

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:46.610
That's right!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:47.280
Schwarz!

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:50.240
Hurry up and take that mask off.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.080
Kyoji!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:56.620
It's really Kyoji!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:58.170
Domon...

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.630
...you did well.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:01.880
Kyoji.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.800
But be careful.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:07.110
Be careful of that island.

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:10.550
Kyoji!

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:14.770
Kyoji!

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:28.280
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:30.780
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:38.620
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:43.750
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:47.420
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:54.140
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.390 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:06.230
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:09.820
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:17.290
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:26.130
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:34.260
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:36.390
The Final is coming up!

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:38.410
On an enormous ring
on Lantau Island...

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:41.270
...Domon and the others
carry on a vicious fight.

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:44.560
Which one of the Gundam
Fighters will become champion?

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:49.110
And a dreadful monster
makes another appearance!

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:51.780
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:56.080
Battle Royale Begins!
Devil Gundam Revived

00:23:54.320 --> 00:24:00.990
Battle Royale Begins!
Devil Gundam Revived

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.410
Ready! Go!
